APP-TEAMS-NEW|APPS|Remove: Teams (new client)|Removes the Teams (new client) app from your Windows account.|Its features become unavailable. Save any data you need first. Rollback works only while the app files remain on disk; otherwise it must be reinstalled.|If the app is absent, the action is skipped. Other accounts are not affected in normal mode.
