APP-DEVHOME|APPS|Remove: Dev Home|Removes the Dev Home app from your Windows account.|Its features become unavailable. Save any data you need first. Rollback works only while the app files remain on disk; otherwise it must be reinstalled.|If the app is absent, the action is skipped. Other accounts are not affected in normal mode.
APP-STARTEXP|APPS|Remove: Start menu recommendations|Removes the Start menu recommendations app from your Windows account.|Its features become unavailable. Save any data you need first. Rollback works only while the app files remain on disk; otherwise it must be reinstalled.|If the app is absent, the action is skipped. Other accounts are not affected in normal mode.
APP-WIDGETS-RT|APPS|Remove: Widgets runtime|Removes the Widgets runtime app from your Windows account.|Its features become unavailable. Save any data you need first. Rollback works only while the app files remain on disk; otherwise it must be reinstalled.|If the app is absent, the action is skipped. Other accounts are not affected in normal mode.
APP-EDGE-GAMEASSIST|APPS|Remove: Edge Game Assist|Removes the Edge Game Assist app from your Windows account.|Its features become unavailable. Save any data you need first. Rollback works only while the app files remain on disk; otherwise it must be reinstalled.|If the app is absent, the action is skipped. Other accounts are not affected in normal mode.
